      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">REVENUE CODE REFERENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">4-digit NUBC department identifiers on UB-04 claims</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"140\" width=\"490\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0100-01x</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Room &amp; Board</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"140\" width=\"470\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0250</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Pharmacy (general)</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"250\" width=\"490\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0260</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">IV Therapy</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"250\" width=\"470\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0270</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Med-Surg Supplies</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"360\" width=\"490\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0301</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Lab / Chemistry</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"360\" width=\"470\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0320</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Radiology / Diagnostic</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"470\" width=\"490\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.12)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0360</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Operating Room</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"470\" width=\"470\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0450</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Emergency Room</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"580\" width=\"490\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0710</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Recovery Room</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"580\" width=\"470\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">0001</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Total Charges (summary)</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"710\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"753\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"18\">Revenue codes are required on every line of a UB-04 institutional claim</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Common revenue codes and their department categories"
