     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">CONVERTING DNFB TO DAYS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Dollars mean nothing until you divide by velocity</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"140\" width=\"980\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE INPUTS</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">Unbilled accounts in DNFB</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">$12,600,000</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"305\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">Average daily GROSS revenue</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">$1,800,000</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"400\" width=\"980\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"455\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE FORMULA</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"26\">DNFB dollars / avg daily gross revenue = DNFB days</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"630\" width=\"470\" height=\"290\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"23\">BENCHMARK</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"bold\">4-5</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">days or less</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Coding slice under 3 days</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"630\" width=\"470\" height=\"290\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"805\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"23\">THIS HOSPITAL</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"bold\">?</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">days</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Do the division</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1010\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">Gross revenue, not net — this measures speed, not collections</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1060\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"19\">Every extra day is a full day of gross revenue unbilled</text></svg>",
      "caption": "DNFB in raw dollars is meaningless across hospitals of different sizes. Dividing by average daily gross revenue converts it into days — a comparable measure of billing velocity."
     }
