    {
     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Credit Balances and Refund Processing",
     "content": "A **credit balance** occurs when an account shows that more money was received than is owed -- the account has a negative balance. Credit balances demand immediate attention because they carry significant **compliance and legal risk**.\n\n**Common causes of credit balances**:\n\n• **Payer overpayment** -- The payer paid more than the allowed amount (calculation error, duplicate payment, or retroactive contract change)\n• **Duplicate payments** -- Both the primary and secondary paid the full amount, or the patient paid a copay that was later covered\n• **Retroactive eligibility changes** -- A patient's coverage was backdated, and payments already received now exceed the allowed amount\n• **Posting errors** -- Payment applied to the wrong account or applied twice\n\n**Refund processing rules**:\n\n• **Medicare**: Under **ACA Section 6402**, providers must report and return Medicare overpayments within **60 days** of identification or the date a corresponding cost report is due, whichever is later. Failure to refund = potential **False Claims Act** liability (treble damages + $11,000-23,000+ per claim)\n• **Medicaid**: State-specific rules, but most require refund within 60-90 days\n• **Commercial payers**: Contract-specific, typically 30-90 days; many payers will **auto-recoup** (take back the overpayment by reducing future payments)\n\n**Credit balance management best practices**:\n• Run a **credit balance report** at least monthly\n• Age credit balances -- anything over **90 days** gets escalated\n• Verify the credit is real before refunding (check for pending adjustments or secondary payments)\n• Document the reason for every credit and every refund\n• Track credit balance dollars as a percentage of net revenue -- benchmark: **<0.5%**",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">CREDIT BALANCE MANAGEMENT</text>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Compliance risk and refund requirements</text>\n                        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"490\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"305\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CAUSES</text>\n                        <text x=\"305\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Payer overpayment</text>\n                        <text x=\"305\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Duplicate payments</text>\n                        <text x=\"305\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Retroactive eligibility changes</text>\n                        <text x=\"305\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Posting errors</text>\n                        <rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"810\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">RISKS</text>\n                        <text x=\"810\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">False Claims Act liability</text>\n                        <text x=\"810\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Treble damages + penalties</text>\n                        <text x=\"810\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">$11,000-$23,000+ per claim</text>\n                        <text x=\"810\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">OIG audit exposure</text>\n                        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"380\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"210\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">MEDICARE</text>\n                        <text x=\"210\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Refund within</text>\n                        <text x=\"210\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">60 DAYS</text>\n                        <text x=\"210\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">ACA Section 6402</text>\n                        <rect x=\"400\" y=\"380\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">MEDICAID</text>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">State-specific</text>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">60-90 DAYS</text>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Varies by state</text>\n                        <rect x=\"740\" y=\"380\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"890\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">COMMERCIAL</text>\n                        <text x=\"890\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Per contract</text>\n                        <text x=\"890\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">30-90 DAYS</text>\n                        <text x=\"890\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">May auto-recoup</text>\n                        <rect x=\"150\" y=\"580\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">BENCHMARK</text>\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"652\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Credit balances should be <0.5% of net revenue</text>\n                    </svg>",
      "caption": "Credit balance causes, compliance timelines, and management benchmarks"
     }
    }
