     "explanation": "Medicare Level 1 Redetermination must be filed within 120 days of the date on the Medicare Summary Notice (MSN) or Remittance Advice (RA). The 180-day deadline applies to Level 2 Reconsideration with the QIC. The 60-day deadline applies to Levels 3-5. Confusing these timelines is a common and costly mistake.",
