      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">501(r) collection requirements</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"140\" width=\"800\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">BEFORE ECAs: 501(r) REQUIRES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1. Reasonable efforts to determine FAP eligibility</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2. 120-day notification period</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3. Financial assistance screening completed</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"420\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ECAs INCLUDE:</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Wage garnishment, liens, lawsuits, credit reporting</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"580\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">PENALTY: Loss of tax-exempt status</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Worth millions in annual tax savings</text></svg>",
      "caption": "501(r) requirements before pursuing Extraordinary Collection Actions"
