      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">CLEARINGHOUSE CONCENTRATION RISK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The Change Healthcare lesson: never depend on a single vendor</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"150\" width=\"800\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SINGLE CLEARINGHOUSE FAILURE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">One ransomware attack = thousands of providers unable to process claims</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Weeks of disruption to national payment processing</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"330\" width=\"400\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">THE RISK</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">All claims through ONE vendor</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Single point of failure</text><rect x=\"600\" y=\"330\" width=\"400\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">THE FIX</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Backup clearinghouse contracts</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Tested downtime procedures</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Clearinghouse concentration risk: the lesson from Change Healthcare"
